#: app/ui/git/dialogos.py:452
msgid ""
"La bisección busca el commit que introdujo un fallo probando commits a medio camino.\n"
"\n"
"1. Indique un commit malo (donde ya falla; normalmente el actual) y uno bueno (donde aún funcionaba).\n"
"2. Git cambia los archivos a un commit intermedio. Pruebe el programa y diga si ese commit está bien o mal (o sáltelo si no se puede probar).\n"
"3. Repita hasta que git anuncie el primer commit malo.\n"
"4. Termine la bisección para volver a su rama.\n"
"\n"
"Mientras dure, no haga commits."
msgstr ""
"Bisecting finds the commit that introduced a bug by testing commits halfway in between.\n"
"\n"
"1. Indicate a bad commit (where it already fails; usually the current one) and a good one (where it still worked).\n"
"2. Git switches the files to an intermediate commit. Test the program and say whether that commit is good or bad (or skip it if it cannot be tested).\n"
"3. Repeat until git announces the first bad commit.\n"
"4. Finish the bisect to return to your branch.\n"
"\n"
"While it is in progress, do not make any commits."

